We need your support to keep moving forward</h2>\n                    <table style=\"margin-top: 20px;\"><tr><td></td><td style=\"padding-top: 0;\">By sharing your unique opinion on WP Cerber, you help the engineers behind the plugin make greater progress and help other professionals find the right software. You can leave your review on one of the following websites. Feel free to use your native language. Thanks!\n                    </td></tr></table>\n                       \n                    <p><a href=\"https://www.trustpilot.com/evaluate/wpcerber.com\" target=\"_blank\">Leave review on Trustpilot</a>\n                    &nbsp;|&nbsp; \n                    <a href=\"https://www.trustradius.com/products/wp-cerber-security/reviews\" target=\"_blank\">Leave review on TrustRadius</a><p style=\"text-align:right; padding-right: 20px;\">\n    		    <input type=\"button\" class=\"button button-primary crb-dismiss-trigger\" data-crb-context=\"new_release_announcement\" value=\" &nbsp; Awesome! &nbsp; \"/></p>','off'),(144246,'cerber-groove','GmTwe3QItnpLS5Ju','off'),(144247,'cerber-groove-x','a:2:{i:0;s:29:\"XhsKEdToFQSR2nvkOeNA8V36YU5fW\";i:1;s:27:\"Du7xTSoAPGjn1sEq5WMc6KyNtCg\";}','off'),(144267,'_cerber_notify_new','a:2:{i:0;s:3:\"9.9\";i:1;s:5:\"9.9.5\";}','off'),(144268,'mainwp_child_update_version','1.6.4','on'),(144270,'mainwp_child_plugin_version','6.1.8','on'),(144271,'mainwp_child_auth','a:6:{i:5;s:32:\"dc4742112eef44d57963a0a9e294b208\";s:4:\"last\";i:1788254599;i:4;s:32:\"a30d3ed24eece7f67474d0d87b6460a4\";i:3;s:32:\"498f4d85799dd12300a966476e024213\";i:2;s:32:\"690a5a9c547103f8d0d0758eca3fe010\";i:1;s:32:\"29e93ef682289f292d77e63f61c507cc\";}','on'),(144272,'mainwp_pw_max_age_days','0','off'),(144273,'mainwp_pw_due_soon_days','7','off'),(144274,'mainwp_pw_due_soon_message','Your password is due to be changed soon. Please update it as soon as possible. This helps keep your account secure.','off'),(144275,'mainwp_pw_overdue_message','Your password change i