a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#interactive-states-styling-hover-focus\">Interactive states styling (hover, focus)</a></li></ol></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#media-editor-modal-and-free-form-image-cropper\">Media editor modal and free-form image cropper</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#client-side-media-processing-improvements\">Client-side media processing improvements</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#icons-now-inherit-color-and-the-icons-api-takes-shape\">Icons now inherit color, and the Icons API takes shape</a><ol><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#for-developers-registering-more-collections\">For developers: Registering more collections</a></li></ol></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#admin-bar-everywhere\">Admin Bar everywhere </a></li></ol></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#new-blocks\">New Blocks</a><ol><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#playlist-block\">Playlist block</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#tabs-block\">Tabs block</a></li></ol></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#improved-blocks-and-block-handling\">Improved Blocks and Block handling</a><ol><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#block-transforms-preview-first-convert-faster\">Block transforms: preview first, convert faster</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#combine-gradient-and-image-backgrounds\">Combine gradient and image backgrounds</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#cover-block-control-video-embed-providers\">Cover Block: control video embed providers</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#gallery-attached\">Gallery and the attached images workflow in the Media Library</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#image-block\">Image Block: Mark as decorative toggle</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#login-out-block-improvements\">Login/out Block Improvements</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#navigation-block-and-link-creation\">Navigation Block and Link Creation</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#search-block-styling-theme-builder-site-admin-end-user\">Search block Styling</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#query-block\">Query block</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#general-quality-of-life-improvements\">General quality of life improvements. </a><ol><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#pattern-editing-experience-improvements\">Pattern editing experience improvements</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#block-width-and-layout-controls\"> Block Width and Layout Controls</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtimes.com/feed/#link-control-and-preview-enhancements\">Link Control and Preview Enhancements</a></li><li><a class=\"wp-block-table-of-contents__entry\" href=\"https://gutenbergtim