ia-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M549.655 124.083c-6.281-23.65-24.787-42.276-48.284-48.597C458.781 64 288 64 288 64S117.22 64 74.629 75.486c-23.497 6.322-42.003 24.947-48.284 48.597-11.412 42.867-11.412 132.305-11.412 132.305s0 89.438 11.412 132.305c6.281 23.65 24.787 41.5 48.284 47.821C117.22 448 288 448 288 448s170.78 0 213.371-11.486c23.497-6.321 42.003-24.171 48.284-47.821 11.412-42.867 11.412-132.305 11.412-132.305s0-89.438-11.412-132.305zm-317.51 213.508V175.185l142.739 81.205-142.739 81.201z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n							<h2>03</h2>','Nosotros','','inherit','closed','closed','','120-revision-v1','','','2026-07-14 10:17:37','2026-07-14 10:17:37','',120,'http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/?p=302',0,'revision','',0),(303,1,'2026-07-14 10:17:37','2026-07-14 10:17:37','<h2>Arquitectura &amp; Bienestar<br>sin Concesiones</h2>															<img width=\"800\" height=\"199\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/signature-M6UF5EY-1024x255.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/signature-M6UF5EY-1024x255.png 1024w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/signature-M6UF5EY-600x149.png 600w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/signature-M6UF5EY-300x75.png 300w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/signature-M6UF5EY-768x191.png 768w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/signature-M6UF5EY-1536x382.png 1536w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/signature-M6UF5EY.png 1844w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													<p style=\"color:#EABB61; font-weight:600;\">Dirección de Proyectos & Arquitectura Tecnopremium</p>													<img width=\"682\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/trendy-open-space-living-and-dining-room-interior-with-grey-couch-and-wooden-furniture-682x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/trendy-open-space-living-and-dining-room-interior-with-grey-couch-and-wooden-furniture-682x1024.jpg 682w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/trendy-open-space-living-and-dining-room-interior-with-grey-couch-and-wooden-furniture-600x900.jpg 600w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/trendy-open-space-living-and-dining-room-interior-with-grey-couch-and-wooden-furniture-200x300.jpg 200w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/trendy-open-space-living-and-dining-room-interior-with-grey-couch-and-wooden-furniture-768x1152.jpg 768w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/trendy-open-space-living-and-dining-room-interior-with-grey-couch-and-wooden-furniture-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/trendy-open-space-living-and-dining-room-interior-with-grey-couch-and-wooden-furniture.jpg 1333w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 682px) 100vw, 682px\" />																		\n				<p>Diseñamos atmósferas vivas donde la arquitectura contemporánea se funde con la hidroterapia de alto rendimiento y la excelencia estructural. Cada proyecto es ejecutado con materiales de ingeniería europea certificados para garantizar durabilidad, eficiencia energética y una estética atemporal.</p><p>Diseñamos atmósferas vivas donde la arquitectura contemporánea se funde con la hidroterapia de alto rendimiento y la excelencia estructural. Cada proyecto es ejecutado con materiales de ingeniería europea certificados para garantizar durabilidad, eficiencia energética y una estética atemporal.</p>													<img width=\"800\" height=\"308\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/white-furniture-with-wooden-elements-1024x394.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/white-furniture-with-wooden-elements-1024x394.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/white-furniture-with-wooden-elements-600x231.jpg 600w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/white-furniture-with-wooden-elements-300x115.jpg 300w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/white-furniture-with-wooden-elements-768x295.jpg 768w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/white-furniture-with-wooden-elements-1536x591.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/white-furniture-with-wooden-elements.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />																<h2>01</h2>							\n			Años de Experiencia en Proyectos Wellness			\n				0\n									<ul>\n							<li>\n										2.167 - Proyectos Instalados\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										86 - Especialistas e Ingenieros\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										1.146 - Clientes Satisfechos\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										14 - Showrooms en España\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n							<h2>Por Qué Elegir Tecnopremium</h2>					<h2>Ingeniería Bioclimática &amp; Wellness de Alta Precisión</h2>							\n																	<img width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-300x300.jpg 300w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-100x100.jpg 100w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-600x600.jpg 600w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-150x150.jpg 150w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-768x768.jpg 768w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />																<h2>Diseñamos tu Espacio Exterior de Lujo</h2>							\n							<h2>01</h2>							\n									<h3>\n							Diseño Arquitectónico CAD/BIM						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Estudio técnico integral, mediciones en obra y modelado 3D paisajístico para armonizar tu terraza o jardín.					</p>\n							<h2>02</h2>							\n									<h3>\n							Pérgolas Bioclimáticas A Medida						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Estructuras de aluminio termolacado con lamas orientables y control domótico inteligente para protección solar.					</p>\n							<h2>03</h2>							\n									<h3>\n							Spas y Wellness Outdoor						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Hidromasaje exterior de alta eficiencia con aislamiento térmico ProLast™ y tecnología de depuración avanzada.					</p>\n							<h2>04</h2>							\n									<h3>\n							Instalación Llave en Mano						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Montaje especializado ejecutado por ingenieros propios con certificación oficial, puesta en marcha y mantenimiento.					</p>\n							<h2>02</h2>							\n				0\n							<h2>Proyectos Wellness Completados</h2>							\n				0\n							<h2>Arquitectos &amp; Especialistas</h2>							\n				0\n							<h2>Clientes &amp; Estudios Satisfechos</h2>							\n				0\n							<h2>Delegaciones Oficiales</h2>							\n							<h2>Marcas y Fabricantes Oficiales</h2>															<img width=\"265\" height=\"148\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcas/luxury/luxury_Jacuzzi.png\" alt=\"\" />																										<img width=\"300\" height=\"289\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcas/luxury/luxury_Renson-300x289.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcas/luxury/luxury_Renson-300x289.png 300w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcas/luxury/luxury_Renson.png 473w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />																										<img width=\"147\" height=\"55\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcas/luxury/luxury_Talenti.png\" alt=\"\" />																										<img width=\"131\" height=\"139\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcas/luxury/luxury_OF.png\" alt=\"\" />																										<img width=\"140\" height=\"130\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcas/luxury/luxury_C3.png\" alt=\"\" />																										<img width=\"183\" height=\"124\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcas/luxury/luxury_KE.png\" alt=\"\" />																										<img width=\"208\" height=\"49\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcas/luxury/luxury_Brustor.png\" alt=\"\" />																<h2>Equipo Técnico &amp; Consultoría</h2>					<h2>Especialistas en Ingeniería Exterior</h2>							\n								<img width=\"1920\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Pergolas-bioclimaticas-Innovacion-y-sostenibilidad.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Pergolas-bioclimaticas-Innovacion-y-sostenibilidad.jpg 1920w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/0