ury/luxury_Komoon.png\" alt=\"luxury_Komoon\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcas/luxury/luxury_Alpha.png\" alt=\"luxury_Alpha\" /></figure>			\n			Años de Experiencia en Proyectos Wellness			\n				0\n									<ul>\n							<li>\n										2.167 - Proyectos Instalados\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										86 - Especialistas e Ingenieros\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										1.146 - Clientes Satisfechos\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										14 - Showrooms en España\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n							<h2>Por Qué Elegir Tecnopremium</h2>					<h2>Ingeniería Bioclimática &amp; Wellness de Alta Precisión</h2>							\n																	<img width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-300x300.jpg 300w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-100x100.jpg 100w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-600x600.jpg 600w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-150x150.jpg 150w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-768x768.jpg 768w, http://localhost/Khumbu/teknopremium/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/living-room-decorated-with-chairs-picture-frames-and-small-plant-pots-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, http://loca